*.joblib
# Step 6 (Option 1): only the five approved v0 SHADOW artifacts are tracked, so every machine has the exact files
# whose fingerprints are in apps/ml-service/models/v0/registry.json. Every other .joblib / .pkl stays ignored.
!apps/ml-service/models/v0/intent.joblib
!apps/ml-service/models/v0/abandonment.joblib
!apps/ml-service/models/v0/fraud.joblib
!apps/ml-service/models/v0/demand.joblib
!apps/ml-service/models/v0/crowd.joblib
*.pkl

